! Example command snippet for a free body (no supports): automatic inertia relief.
! Use "apdl": "inertia_relief.apdl" in case.json and remove fixed_supports.
! AIRL needs bonded contact with small sliding on EVERY CONTA174 type, and
! Mechanical's generated remote-mass attachments omit it, so set KEYOPT(18) on all.
! Explicit six modes: automatic counting conflicted with remote-point DOFs.
FINISH
/PREP7
*GET,_fea_etmax,ETYP,0,NUM,MAX
*DO,_fea_et,1,_fea_etmax
  *GET,_fea_en,ETYP,_fea_et,ATTR,ENAM
  *IF,_fea_en,EQ,174,THEN
    KEYOPT,_fea_et,18,1
  *ENDIF
*ENDDO
ALLSEL,ALL
SHPP,WARN
FINISH
/SOLU
AIRL,6
NEQIT,1,FORCE
